	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"漫画『ドラゴンボール』の扉絵に登場したブルマのバイクが立体化！",
			"• 高速で走る基本形態の「バイクモード」から、二足歩行形態の「バイペダルモード」や、不安定な荒野もパワフルに走り抜ける三輪の「トライクモード」へと可変！",
			"• メカの精密なディテールを再現するとともに、“メカ不思議”な７つのギミックを搭載！"
		],
		"en": [
			"Bulma's bike that appeared in the cover art of the manga \"Dragon Ball\" is now three-dimensional!",
			"• Changeable from the basic \"bike mode\" that runs at high speed, to the \"bipedal mode\" that walks on two legs, and the three-wheeled \"trike mode\" that allows you to run powerfully through unstable wilderness!",
			"• In addition to reproducing the precise details of the mechanism, it is also equipped with 7 “mysterious mechanical” gimmicks!"
		]
	},
